# Deny-all, then allow just what the image needs. The repo carries several GB of
# videos, datasets and training runs; an allow-list keeps them out of the build
# context by default instead of relying on remembering to exclude each one.
*

!sokil/
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md

# Re-excluded after the allow-list above, which would otherwise pull these in
# from the directories it re-includes.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
